    description: "Add access_mode and channel to meta on edges produced by existing\npub/sub linkers (Tier 2 — explicit annotation):\n\n- event_sourcing.py: event_publishes → write, event_subscribes → read\n- message_queue.py: mq_publishes → write, mq_subscribes → read\n- websocket.py: websocket_message send → write, receive → read\n- ipc.py: Electron send → write, receive → read\n- tauri_ipc.py: invoke → write (request), command → read (handler)\n- wasm_bindgen.py: JS import → write (call), Rust export → read (impl)\n\nEach linker already has meta dicts. Adding access_mode is one key per\nEdge.create call. Estimated: ~50 lines total across 6 files.\n\nDepends on: Edge schema (access_mode kwargs available).\nSee ADR-0015 §7."  # 3c30
    fields: {}  # 3c30
